##! experimental.givens

// The regional view of the ecommerce model. It builds on ecommerce.malloy and
// gs.malloy in this directory (copies of ../ecommerce's; a dataset is compiled
// from its own directory alone, so it cannot import across datasets) and
// narrows it to the asker's country. Keep the copies in step with ../ecommerce.
//
// Selective import, on purpose: a bare import would bring the ecommerce
// model's dashboard filter givens along with it.
import { all_order_items is order_items } from 'ecommerce.malloy'

#" Every role the signed-in person holds. Malloyyo fills this and a caller
#" cannot set it. The default matches no country, so an unsupplied value
#" shows nothing.
given: MALLOYYO_ROLES :: string[] is ['']

// The ONLY scoping rule, and deliberately nothing else: a role named for a
// country ('usa', 'uk' — the lowercase of the data's USA / UK) sees that
// country's orders. There is no role that widens this; people who need every
// country are granted the unscoped `ecommerce` dataset instead.
#" Ecommerce orders, narrowed to the countries of the roles you hold.
source: order_items is all_order_items extend {
  where: lower(users.country) in $MALLOYYO_ROLES
}
